1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:57,120
This person has been chasing me all the way from Zhao

25
00:01:57,880 --> 00:02:00,280
and I still can't determine his cultivation level.

26
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:11,520
Even if you have the stones to operate the teleportation formation,

27
00:02:09,550 --> 00:02:12,480
Na Duo\NFive Elements Planet's cultivator\NEarly stage Soul Transformation

28
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:13,200
do you think you can escape ?

29
00:02:14,850 --> 00:02:16,280
What a powerful Divine Sense !

30
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:22,080
After a single attack,

31
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:24,560
my Nascent Soul is already at the brink of collapse.

32
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:26,280
What's...

33
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:28,640
his cultivation level ?

34
00:02:31,480 --> 00:02:33,080
His power feels familiar...

35
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:34,800
Could it be ?

36
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:37,760
This cannot continue,

37
00:02:38,440 --> 00:02:39,760
I cannot let him take the initiative,

38
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,240
cause if he does, I will die.

39
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:45,680
I need to fight back to survive.

40
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:56,800
His flag isn't finished.

41
00:02:57,190 --> 00:02:59,880
If he finishes is, it will trigger a tribulation.

42
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:03,720
I didn't expect

43
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:06,240
to find this kind of artifact

44
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:08,400
on this waste of a planet.

45
00:03:09,180 --> 00:03:10,480
Fortunately, before this trip,

46
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,920
I refined another nearly-finished restriction flag.

47
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:14,920
Looks like it can threaten him.

48
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:17,080
Senior has been following me

49
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,280
with great killing intent.

50
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:20,240
What does Senior want from me ?

51
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:23,200
If my cultivation was at its prime,

52
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:24,160
this would be easy.

53
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:26,400
But I only recovered 30% of my power...

54
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:29,440
if I fight a tribulation now, I will get hurt again.

55
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:34,240
Junior, give me the bag you found in the Land of the Ancient God.

56
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,180
The Land of the Ancient God ?

57
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:45,920
Is this what Senior wants ?

58
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:47,480
That's right.

59
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,080
In the past,

60
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:53,160
I got seriously injured.

61
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:56,560
So I went to the Land of the Ancient God to find treasures to help me recover.

62
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:59,800
I got into some trouble there.

63
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:02,520
The Blood Sea Warriors chased me

64
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:05,120
so in order to safeguard my findings,

65
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:07,120
I had no other choice

66
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:09,320
but to hide my bag of holding.

67
00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:11,920
I wanted to take it back later.

68
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:14,320
But as you know,

69
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:16,490
it ended up in your hands.

70
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:18,120
I have returned the bag to you,

71
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:19,880
I will now take my leave.

72
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:45,400
Stop !

73
00:04:45,420 --> 00:04:46,500
Little friend,

74
00:04:46,530 --> 00:04:47,440
don't be rash !

75
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:50,120
Why did Senior go back on his word ?

76
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:52,200
Was the red lightning you used before

77
00:04:52,200 --> 00:04:53,320
the Ji Realm ?

78
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:59,360
Junior, you really are full of surprises.

79
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:02,440
Not only do you have a treasure that can attract a tribulation

80
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:04,160
but you also have the Ji Realm.

81
00:05:04,880 --> 00:05:06,360
If Senior doesn't have anything else

82
00:05:07,200 --> 00:05:08,460
then Junior will take his leave.

83
00:05:08,090 --> 00:05:11,140
Do you want to breakthrough your Ji Realm bottleneck ?

84
00:05:13,280 --> 00:05:14,320
Little friend,

85
00:05:14,320 --> 00:05:15,560
do you know what this is ?

86
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:21,400
Ji Realm ?

87
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,440
On my home planet,

88
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:25,320
it's called the Five Colored Ji Realm.

89
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:27,280
This wasn't originally mine.

90
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:29,240
It was gifted to me by a friend

91
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,840
as he was dying.

92
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:34,920
You remind me of him.

93
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:37,080
In the whole Cultivation Alliance,

94
00:05:37,320 --> 00:05:39,720
Ji Realm cultivators are very rare.

95
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:42,530
I cannot tell the properties of your Ji Realm

96
00:05:42,540 --> 00:05:44,800
but I know how you can breakthrough.

97
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:47,920
The Cultivation Planet Crystal is given

98
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:49,560
to a country when it reaches rank 6.

99
00:05:49,880 --> 00:05:52,680
The old monsters of the Cultivation Alliance use their powers

100
00:05:52,760 --> 00:05:54,560
to form the crystal.

101
00:05:55,880 --> 00:05:58,880
It's a rank 6 cultivation country's national treasure.

102
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:00,880
If you obtain and refine it,

103
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:03,600
you can breakthrough your Ji Realm.

104
00:06:08,520 --> 00:06:10,960
If you obtain the crystal and get the qualifications

105
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:13,520
to leave this waste of a planet

106
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:16,080
you can come find me on the Five Elements Planet,

107
00:06:16,640 --> 00:06:18,280
my name is Na Duo.

108
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:24,960
Luckily, I managed to avoid this fight.

109
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:36,080
If I can reach Soul Transformation

110
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:39,090
then I may have a chance to get the Cultivation Planet Crystal

111
00:06:39,110 --> 00:06:40,520
to breakthrough my Ji Realm.

112
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:43,060
But for now,

113
00:06:43,070 --> 00:06:44,960
I need to reach Soul Formation.

114
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:48,000
Understanding the heavens

115
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:49,720
is crucial for that.

116
00:06:50,080 --> 00:06:51,800
But I have spent my whole life

117
00:06:51,840 --> 00:06:53,800
following the demonic path.

118
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:56,520
If I want to breakthrough,

119
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:58,000
there is only one way:

120
00:06:57,320 --> 00:07:00,400
Wang Lin's avatar\NEarly stage Nascent Soul

121
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:02,080
becoming a mortal.

122
00:07:07,210 --> 00:07:09,640
Four Sect Alliance

123
00:07:27,520 --> 00:07:28,600
The Four Sect Alliance

124
00:07:29,200 --> 00:07:31,010
is a rank 4 cultivation country.

125
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:38,640
Lu Xing

126
00:07:37,440 --> 00:07:38,240
Let's rest here.

127
00:07:43,440 --> 00:07:44,360
Go ahead.

128
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:44,920
Alright.

129
00:07:45,280 --> 00:07:46,960
Sir, are you passing by or staying ?

130
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:49,520
I see that you carry medicinal herbs in your backpack.

131
00:07:49,760 --> 00:07:50,770
I wonder if Brother

132
00:07:50,780 --> 00:07:52,360
could possibly be a traveling doctor ?

133
00:07:54,760 --> 00:07:55,680
I am Lu Xing.

134
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:56,480
Brother,

135
00:07:56,960 --> 00:07:58,280
do you have any medicine

136
00:07:58,560 --> 00:08:00,830
to cure the evil wind. (regular cold)

137
00:08:00,960 --> 00:08:01,920
Is someone sick ?

138
00:08:03,320 --> 00:08:04,600
A servant girl is sick.

139
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:07,440
We are still 7 days away from the capital

140
00:08:07,760 --> 00:08:09,480
and the medecine prescribed by the doctor

141
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:10,960
isn't very effective.

142
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,440
Perhaps...

143
00:08:12,640 --> 00:08:15,240
this is my opportunity to enter the mortal world.

144
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:17,240
Please lead the way.

145
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:19,360
Please.

146
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:26,720
Brother,

147
00:08:26,880 --> 00:08:27,840
just look from here,

148
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:29,320
there is no need to go inside.

149
00:08:31,400 --> 00:08:32,520
Please stretch out your hand.

150
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:42,820
She clearly isn't a servant, but the master.

151
00:08:43,920 --> 00:08:44,720
Poison ?

152
00:08:54,320 --> 00:08:57,120
Have her eat it raw, she will be cured by tomorrow.

153
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:57,920
This...

154
00:08:58,760 --> 00:09:01,520
This looks like an ordinary willow tree leaf.

155
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:06,360
I'm afraid this guy isn't a doctor.

156
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:08,000
He is clearly a lunatic.

157
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:12,680
A hundred-years old willow leaf !

158
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:16,640
I don't know how to consume it.

159
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:18,520
Is there any trick to using this leaf ?

160
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:20,000
Eating it raw is fine.

161
00:09:41,520 --> 00:09:43,400
I didn't expect that in just 400 years,

162
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:46,240
I could accumulate so much killing intent.

163
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:49,000
I killed way too many people...

164
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:51,480
If I allow this aura to grow,

165
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:52,800
over time,

166
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:55,200
it will corrupt my Dao Heart.

167
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:57,880
The killing intent can be domineering

168
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,280
and used for spells.

169
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,680
But if I want to turn into a mortal

170
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:04,320
it will ententually dissipate.

171
00:10:05,520 --> 00:10:06,640
It's a pity...

172
00:10:22,280 --> 00:10:24,480
The best I can do is condense it.

173
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:26,320
That's fine.

174
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:27,340
Hey Brother,

175
00:10:27,350 --> 00:10:29,000
your leaves are really magical.

176
00:10:29,160 --> 00:10:29,980
My daught-

177
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:32,760
My servant feels much better.

178
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:35,520
Come on,

179
00:10:35,520 --> 00:10:36,720
let's toast !

180
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:48,250
It's been a long time since I drank with someone.

181
00:10:50,400 --> 00:10:51,560
Come on, cheers !

182
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:00,760
Old man,

183
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:04,520
I've heard you talk about Xing Fen Tower countless times.

184
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:05,800
Enough.

185
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:06,960
This time,

186
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:09,680
I will see if you're just bragging.

187
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:10,760
Go ahead.

188
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:12,560
You'll be drunk soon anyway.

189
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:15,450
I'll wait for you to pass out and I'll start.

190
00:11:15,460 --> 00:11:16,630
No...

191
00:11:16,660 --> 00:11:17,260
You...

192
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:21,120
Let's toast for him !

193
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:23,040
What a drinker !

194
00:11:23,040 --> 00:11:24,120
Come, cheers!

195
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:28,480
You should drink less, we have to keep guard.

196
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:29,800
It's been a long time

197
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:32,080
since I saw this side of Life.

198
00:11:48,240 --> 00:11:49,650
Today, without noticing,

199
00:11:49,690 --> 00:11:51,870
I absorbed spiritual energy extremely fast.

200
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:53,000
Wang Lin's avatar\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul

201
00:11:52,640 --> 00:11:54,960
It made me breakthrough to the Middle stage already.

202
00:11:56,040 --> 00:11:58,120
It seems that distancing myself from cultivation

203
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,240
to become a mortal

204
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:00,920
is the right path.

205
00:12:01,080 --> 00:12:02,560
Now, I will dance for you guys.

206
00:12:02,560 --> 00:12:03,640
Let's have fun !

207
00:12:03,920 --> 00:12:05,120
Have fun ?

208
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:07,320
Am I making a fool of myself ?

209
00:12:07,800 --> 00:12:08,960
Of course you are !

210
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:13,080
Look over here !

211
00:12:13,160 --> 00:12:14,760
Quality woven clothes !

212
00:12:15,320 --> 00:12:17,080
Cold powder ! Cold powder !

213
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:21,420
Brother Wang,

214
00:12:21,450 --> 00:12:22,870
don't keep staring at them.

215
00:12:22,920 --> 00:12:25,280
If you are noticed, we will be troubled.

216
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:26,560
Brother Lu,

217
00:12:26,920 --> 00:12:28,320
what are these black pillars ?

218
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:30,640
Those are Immortal pillars.

219
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:32,840
This place is my country's capital

220
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:35,200
so it's protected by Immortals, hence the Immortal pillars.

221
00:12:35,640 --> 00:12:38,240
There are Immortals living inside the pillars.

222
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:41,630
Although they are merely Foundation Establishment,

223
00:12:41,680 --> 00:12:43,360
it's rare to protect the mortal world like that,

224
00:12:43,680 --> 00:12:44,800
very rare.

225
00:12:46,360 --> 00:12:48,400
I didn't expect you to know so much about Immortals.

226
00:12:49,520 --> 00:12:51,760
What's the meaning of the Four Sect Alliance ?

227
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:54,160
There are 4 cultivation sects

228
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:56,160
in our country.

229
00:12:57,040 --> 00:13:00,160
The righteous and virtuous White Cloud Sect.

230
00:13:01,400 --> 00:13:04,600
The Water Ink Sect, with its bustling rivers and waterfalls.

231
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:08,880
The Green Wood Sect, blessed by the sky and the earth.

232
00:13:09,400 --> 00:13:13,120
And the Black Soul Sect, hidden in darkness.

233
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:16,520
These 4 sects are relatively independent.

234
00:13:16,680 --> 00:13:18,620
They each collect disciples in the mortal world.

235
00:13:18,680 --> 00:13:21,770
Whenever there's a big event, they cooperate.

236
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:24,240
That's why it's called the Four Sect Alliance.

237
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:26,760
To be honest,

238
00:13:26,920 --> 00:13:29,440
my dream was to become an Immortal.

239
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:32,560
But the crown prince was so kind to me.

240
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:34,520
If it weren't for that,

241
00:13:34,760 --> 00:13:37,480
I might have become an Immortal.

242
00:13:38,800 --> 00:13:41,560
I heard that cultivation depends on talent and opportunity.

243
00:13:41,680 --> 00:13:42,960
It's not something you decide.

244
00:13:43,440 --> 00:13:44,880
Life is short.

245
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:47,800
It's better to be happy here.

246
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:51,120
You know me well Brother !

247
00:13:53,760 --> 00:13:54,320
Brother Lu,

248
00:13:54,850 --> 00:13:56,350
let's part ways here.

249
00:13:58,880 --> 00:14:00,200
The young lady asked me to thank you.

250
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:01,560
Here are 10 taels of gold,

251
00:14:01,640 --> 00:14:02,760
consider it your payment.

252
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:02,760
Note: 1 tael = 37.5g

253
00:14:03,680 --> 00:14:04,480
Thank you.

254
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:19,840
Spoiler

255
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:17,880
You old pervert !

256
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:20,160
You came to my shop to see the women changing their clothes ?

257
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:21,830
Deserved !

258
00:14:20,710 --> 00:14:22,880
At such an age, how could you be so lewd ?

259
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:25,000
I'll hit you every time I see you !

260
00:14:25,880 --> 00:14:26,680
Get lost !

261
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:28,720
I'll beat you to death !

262
00:14:29,040 --> 00:14:29,920
Alright.

263
00:14:32,920 --> 00:14:33,600
Hey

264
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:34,400
young man,

265
00:14:34,650 --> 00:14:36,600
your forehead is wide,

266
00:14:34,650 --> 00:14:36,650
(Note: sign of luck, talent)

267
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:37,960
energy envelops your body,

268
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:39,480
you must be special !

269
00:14:40,360 --> 00:14:41,760
I've hidden my cultivation.

270
00:14:42,280 --> 00:14:43,800
This person is just a mortal,

271
00:14:44,400 --> 00:14:45,680
he cannot see through me.

272
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:48,520
If no one guides you,

273
00:14:48,520 --> 00:14:51,040
I'm afraid you will never reach Soul Formation.

274
00:14:51,680 --> 00:14:52,660
What a pity !

275
00:14:52,690 --> 00:14:54,170
How pitiful...

276
00:14:54,250 --> 00:14:55,080
Who are you ?

277
00:14:56,160 --> 00:14:58,240
You don't need to know who I am.

278
00:14:58,560 --> 00:15:02,840
But I know how to make you reach Soul Formation.

279
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:11,010
Senior,

280
00:15:11,010 --> 00:15:12,160
please teach me.

281
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:14,760
I'm getting old.

282
00:15:14,920 --> 00:15:16,600
The moment I get hungry,

283
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:18,880
I can't remember anything.

284
00:15:19,920 --> 00:15:21,680
I know a very good restaurant.

285
00:15:21,760 --> 00:15:24,720
Let's go there and talk while we eat.

286
00:15:27,800 --> 00:15:28,600
Delicious !

287
00:15:29,640 --> 00:15:30,440
It smells so good.

288
00:15:31,280 --> 00:15:33,400
Bring me another duck !

289
00:15:33,400 --> 00:15:34,840
And 2 jars of wine !

290
00:15:38,760 --> 00:15:40,800
Try some, it's so good.

291
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:42,120
Tell me.

292
00:15:42,180 --> 00:15:43,800
How can I reach Soul Formation ?

293
00:15:45,200 --> 00:15:47,290
This, it's easy.

294
00:15:47,340 --> 00:15:48,960
Wait until I finish eating this piece

295
00:15:51,400 --> 00:15:52,840
This old man is really strange.

296
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:55,200
He can see through my cultivation.

297
00:15:56,240 --> 00:15:57,640
If it's not a coincidence,

298
00:15:58,680 --> 00:15:59,960
then his cultivation

299
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:01,640
must be at least Soul Formation.

300
00:16:09,320 --> 00:16:13,240
The Soul Formation stage requires one to understand the heavens

301
00:16:13,560 --> 00:16:16,240
but I believe you already know that.

302
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:17,280
In addition,

303
00:16:17,520 --> 00:16:19,040
to reach Soul Formation

304
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:21,340
you must form your own...

305
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:23,040
domain.

306
00:16:24,160 --> 00:16:26,190
Do you know what a domain is ?

307
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:29,520
Young man,

308
00:16:29,520 --> 00:16:32,000
reflect on this.

309
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:34,250
Once you comprehend what a domain is,

310
00:16:34,300 --> 00:16:36,770
you won't be far from Soul Forma...

311
00:16:42,970 --> 00:16:44,160
...tion

312
00:16:45,920 --> 00:16:47,840
I need to use the restroom.

313
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:49,200
Let's continue when I get back.

314
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:21,520
Young man,

315
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:23,840
your forehead is wide,

316
00:17:23,840 --> 00:17:25,400
energy envelops your body,

317
00:17:25,400 --> 00:17:26,350
you must be special !

318
00:17:26,360 --> 00:17:27,240
Go away.

319
00:17:30,280 --> 00:17:31,000
What a pity...

320
00:17:31,240 --> 00:17:33,160
If no one guides you,

321
00:17:33,160 --> 00:17:36,200
I'm afraid you will never reach Core Formation.

322
00:17:37,440 --> 00:17:38,280
Who are you ?

323
00:17:39,520 --> 00:17:41,720
You don't need to know who I am.

324
00:17:42,520 --> 00:17:43,280
This old man

325
00:17:44,240 --> 00:17:45,770
doesn't scam randomly.

326
00:17:50,080 --> 00:17:51,200
Young man,

327
00:17:51,560 --> 00:17:52,920
if no one guides you,

328
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:54,680
I'm afraid you will never reach Nascent Soul.

329
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:56,600
You don't need to know who I am.

330
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:59,080
Let's find a place to relax

331
00:17:59,280 --> 00:18:01,800
and have a good time.

332
00:18:02,360 --> 00:18:03,230
Okay.

333
00:18:11,480 --> 00:18:12,320
Young man,

334
00:18:12,440 --> 00:18:14,200
how long do you plan to rent ?

335
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:23,200
This is the craft of our family.

336
00:18:23,280 --> 00:18:24,720
Look carefully.

337
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:28,000
Tie Zhu won't work with you in the future.

338
00:18:28,320 --> 00:18:29,880
When I save enough money

339
00:18:30,320 --> 00:18:32,080
you will go to the capital

340
00:18:32,320 --> 00:18:33,400
to become an official.

341
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:38,000
Young man, look.

342
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:40,800
There's a garden in the back.

343
00:18:51,480 --> 00:18:53,200
Although this shop has been empty for many years

344
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:54,200
and is dirty,

345
00:18:54,720 --> 00:18:56,160
you should have everything you need.

346
00:18:56,640 --> 00:18:57,440
I take it.

347
00:18:58,400 --> 00:18:59,080
This much ?

348
00:18:59,090 --> 00:19:00,320
The place is yours then !

349
00:19:17,160 --> 00:19:18,360
You won't catch me !

350
00:19:18,680 --> 00:19:19,440
Wait a second !

351
00:19:20,400 --> 00:19:21,780
I'm sure I can catch you !

352
00:19:21,780 --> 00:19:23,120
No you won't  !

353
00:19:23,360 --> 00:19:24,210
Be careful,

354
00:19:24,220 --> 00:19:25,040
don't make trouble.

355
00:19:26,280 --> 00:19:27,640
Hidden from the world

356
00:19:28,400 --> 00:19:29,520
in a city of mortals.

357
00:19:31,040 --> 00:19:33,080
Far away for the bloody cultivation path,

358
00:19:33,160 --> 00:19:35,040
living life as a mortal.

359
00:19:35,640 --> 00:19:36,720
Maybe,

360
00:19:37,160 --> 00:19:40,160
this is really the way to understand the heavens.

361
00:19:45,720 --> 00:19:46,600
Old man,

362
00:19:47,090 --> 00:19:48,470
what do you want to do tonight ?

363
00:19:48,160 --> 00:19:50,010
Nascent Soul...

364
00:19:50,030 --> 00:19:52,400
Middle stage Nascent Soul ?

365
00:19:53,730 --> 00:19:56,200
Should I help him ?

366
00:19:58,830 --> 00:22:44,990
As I mentioned before in the note of episode 32, the story of that bag of holding differs between the donghua and the novel. Na Duo was cultivating in the War God Shrine a technique to absorb the death energy of corpses. He was severly injured in combat and was recovering from his injuries there for thousands of years and Wang Lin stole his bag while he was uncounscious in his corpse state.\N\NThe explanation of "I hid it there for later" makes very little sense. When you know that Na Duo was so heavily injured that he literally became a corpse in a sect's graveyard in order to recover, the donghua's explanation pales in comparison.

367
00:20:06,770 --> 00:20:10,650
I've had my share of wounds,

368
00:20:08,810 --> 00:20:10,650
now I want to fight back.

369
00:20:10,730 --> 00:20:14,210
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

370
00:20:14,290 --> 00:20:20,130
that's blocking all my hopes

371
00:20:17,170 --> 00:20:20,130
for life ?

372
00:20:21,930 --> 00:20:25,890
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

373
00:20:23,650 --> 00:20:25,890
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

374
00:20:26,210 --> 00:20:29,290
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

375
00:20:29,650 --> 00:20:35,290
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

376
00:20:32,370 --> 00:20:35,290
out of reach.

377
00:20:36,650 --> 00:20:40,770
Immortals

378
00:20:37,690 --> 00:20:40,770
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

379
00:20:41,050 --> 00:20:44,810
Renegades

380
00:20:41,810 --> 00:20:44,810
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

381
00:20:44,810 --> 00:20:48,650
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

382
00:20:46,760 --> 00:20:48,650
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

383
00:20:48,890 --> 00:20:52,770
because I don't see the harm in that.

384
00:20:54,770 --> 00:21:00,570
My new body opens its eyes

385
00:20:57,290 --> 00:21:00,570
and awakens from its dream.

386
00:21:00,690 --> 00:21:08,130
I have overcome many trials

387
00:21:02,810 --> 00:21:08,130
to get this body back.

388
00:21:08,330 --> 00:21:15,770
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

389
00:21:12,370 --> 00:21:15,770
I can still see.

390
00:21:16,170 --> 00:21:25,130
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

391
00:21:20,130 --> 00:21:25,130
by my own hands.

392
00:21:56,010 --> 00:22:01,970
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

393
00:21:58,730 --> 00:22:01,970
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

394
00:22:01,970 --> 00:22:09,530
With a flick of a finger,

395
00:22:03,410 --> 00:22:09,530
only my indomitable heart remains.

396
00:22:09,570 --> 00:22:18,930
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

397
00:22:15,530 --> 00:22:18,930
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

398
00:22:19,170 --> 00:22:26,770
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

399
00:22:21,690 --> 00:22:26,770
like the descent of a god.
